item.description:
A Viceroy butterfly was visiting the Common Boneset in the backyard when I noticed the full black line that goes through the hind wings looked like a partial line. This little one is missing a bit of a wing, but you can see the black lines don't clearly connect from one side to the other;
<img src="https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:7z6ecty3w4vsovvvhlv7nnee/bafkreigu7yf3j7cdh7oxnrsyj3zdgjsfhj3jngand5boobha3zthgito34" alt="" style="max-width:100%;margin-top:8px;">
<img src="https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:7z6ecty3w4vsovvvhlv7nnee/bafkreic7wmzu3ssegz5q6jicbjm43z2plvd457ezirljic5btkxfnou2ku" alt="" style="max-width:100%;margin-top:8px;">

item.content:encoded:
A Viceroy butterfly was visiting the Common Boneset in the backyard when I noticed the full black line that goes through the hind wings looked like a partial line. This little one is missing a bit of a wing, but you can see the black lines don't clearly connect from one side to the other;
